Package: m6APrediction
Title: Random‑Forest Based Prediction of m6A RNA Modification Sites
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Kong",
           family = "Binchu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "Binchu.Kong23@xjtlu.edu.cn")
Description: Predicts candidate m6A RNA modification sites using a pre‑trained random forest model.
  This package accepts sequence‑derived and RNA‑related features and outputs m6A modification probability
  together with binary classification status (Positive / Negative). Includes functions for single‑site
  prediction and batch prediction for multiple candidate sites.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest
